{"id":21,"titleZh":"什么是旋律？","titleEn":"What Is a Melody?","date":"1962-12-21","dateZh":"1962 年 12 月 21 日","concepts":"曲调/主题/动机、“1-2-3”展开法、立体复调线条","thesis":"觉得巴赫或莫扎特“没旋律”，往往是耳朵只顾着盯最上面那一条主线，忽略了藏在内声部与低音里的多条对话旋律。","plain":"能一口气哼完的小曲（Tune）只是旋律的一种，交响曲里更多的是供展开的大主题（Theme）和两三个音的小动机（Motive）。常见旋律遵循“先出现、稍改一遍、第三遍高潮冲出”的推进法则；而在复调织体中，中低声部同样在各自唱着独立的旋律。","scenes":["钢琴从 1 个音、2 个音逐个累加拼图让孩子抢答《婚礼进行曲》，再用柴可夫斯基《悲怆》、贝多芬《第五》和莫扎特《哈夫纳》演示三步冲高的“1-2-3 法则”。","奏莫扎特《第 40 交响曲》前，伯恩斯坦拆开总谱请单簧管单独吹出夹在弦乐上下层之间常被忽略的中声部旋律，随后演绎不靠重复推进的巴赫与欣德米特，并以勃拉姆斯《第四交响曲》末乐章 30 段帕萨卡利亚变奏收官。"],"category":"基础乐理","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1jJ411L71Y","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1jJ411L71Y","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 什么是旋律","duration":"53:06","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/what-is-melody","repertoire":[{"composer":"Wagner","piece":"Prelude to Tristan and Isolde","titleZh":"特里斯坦与伊索尔德前奏曲","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Wagner%20Prelude%20to%20Tristan%20and%20Isolde+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Wagner%20Prelude%20to%20Tristan%20and%20Isolde"},{"composer":"Mozart","piece":"Symphony No. 40 in G Minor, K. 550 (1st Movement)","titleZh":"第 40 交响曲第一乐章","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/e9/9f/c4/e99fc4c2-a490-2a48-d658-86efe9102665/mzaf_3736704169320081595.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/symphony-no-40-in-g-minor-k-550-i-molto-allegro/1452216750?i=1452217023&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Vienna Philharmonic & Leonard Bernstein","recordingTrack":"Symphony No. 40 in G Minor, K. 550: I. Molto Allegro","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Mozart%20Symphony%20No.%2040%20in%20G%20Minor%2C%20K.%20550+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Mozart%20Symphony%20No.%2040%2